  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "We apply each option and solve the given equation using BODMAS rule:**\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/94a3ba98fe537b71a0cedca8cdf679aea0668b950fa8b6ddc2ea6c6e99a6adff.png] \n\nOption 1) 9 and 7\n\n81 + __**31 ÷ 7**__ - 9 = 33\n\n__**81 + **____4.4__ - 9 = 33\n\n__**85.4 - 9**__ = 33\n\n76.4 ≠ 33\n\nOption 2) 31 and 9\n\n81 + __**9 ÷ 31**__ - 7 = 33\n\n__**81 + **____0.2__** - 7 = 33\n\n__**81.2 - 7**__ = 33\n\n74.2 ≠ 33\n\nOption 3) 31 and 81\n\n31 + __**81 ÷ 9**__ - 7 = 33\n\n__**31 + 9**__ - 7 = 33\n\n__**40 - 7**__ = 33\n\n33 = 33\n\nOption 4) 81 and 7 \n\n7 + __**31 ÷ 9**__ - 81 = 33\n\n__**7 + 4.4**__ - 81 = 33\n\n__**11.4 - 81**__ = 33\n\n-69.6 ≠ 33\n\n**Hence the correct answer is option 3.**",
